OL,3,GNEWSAWoman faces hour-long drive to    
OL,4,Agive birth as hospital suspends        
OL,5,Amaternity services                     
OL,7,FA couple who are expecting their first 
OL,8,Fchild have said their excitement has   
OL,9,Fturned "into complete worry" because of
OL,10,Fthe suspension of maternity services at
OL,11,Ftheir local hospital.                  
OL,13,FShelly Magee was due to give birth in  
OL,14,FNewry's Daisy Hill Hospital in County  
OL,15,FArmagh in January but from Monday, the 
OL,16,FSouthern Trust is moving all           
OL,17,Fhospital-based births to Craigavon,    
OL,18,Fabout 20 miles away.                   
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
